destructive actions follow the active agent, workspace, and user authorization rules. Git and rg improve verification; scripts/audit-inventory.sh needs Bash — without it, do the equivalent checks manually. Works on any Agent Skills platform.\nmetadata:\n  version: \"3.1.0\"\n  category: knowledge-governance", "declared_name": "neat-freak", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
